Exact accumulation for OpenCPMD. Default off (-D__EXACT_ACC).
Against 062582b7cfd832d36f88f504cd08e4ead42eb404.

Energy terms that feed etot are exact sums.
Kinetic energy, eigenvalues, the local and nonlocal potentials, the
Hartree pieces, and the XC integrals each add one term at a time.
The cube-root warm start in the XC kernel is replaced by the closed
form, because the Newton start depends on which points share a thread.
GEMAX is an explicit modulus scan. OpenBLAS izamax misses the maximum
for some vector lengths, and the length is the local G count.
The DIIS trust-region gamma is updated on the rank that owns G=0.
That rank is not the parent for every decomposition, so the value is
broadcast from the owner.

